---
description: Backend Python conventions
globs: backend/app/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

- Thin routers.
- Pydantic v2 schemas for all I/O.
- SQLAlchemy 2.0 style.
- Alembic for every schema change.
- One shared role-check dependency.
- Capacity check uses with_for_update() inside a transaction (BR-10).
- Clear rejection reasons incl. remaining seconds.
- ruff-clean.
